    "description": {
     "stringValue": "<p>Get ready for an adrenaline-meets-airflow experience! For the first time in India, we’re bringing you the ultimate outdoor escape. Find your balance on the mat and your stride in the saddle.</p><p><strong>The Experience:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>50 Mins Pilates:</strong> Sculpt, stretch, and find your core strength.</p></li><li><p><strong>35 mins</strong>: Guided equestrian experience</p></li><li><p><strong>15 mins: </strong>Educational stable tour (basically some important tips and tricks for horse riding)</p></li><li><p><strong>The Perks:</strong> Exclusive brand pop-ups, premium goodie bags, and a delicious spread of F&amp;Bs to fuel your morning.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Includes:</strong> Full access to riding &amp; Pilates, a curated goodie bag, and refreshments.</p><blockquote><p><strong>Don’t miss out—let’s ride, flow, and glow!</strong></p></blockquote><p>We are<strong> Main Mission</strong>. Let’s write this next chapter one stride and one stretch at a time.</p>"
