    "description": {
     "stringValue": "<p><strong>Welcome to the Official IRC HYROX Training Community</strong></p><p></p><p><strong>Train with the Indiranagar Run Club as we prepare for HYROX Bangalore on April, 2026</strong>.</p><p>This community is built for runners and athletes who want to build functional strength, sharpen endurance, and prepare specifically for HYROX. Whether you’re competing seriously or trying HYROX for the first time, the focus is on <strong>structured training and measurable improvement.</strong></p><p><strong>Note</strong>: <em>This weekend’s HYROX training will end with a Wall Balls Challenge. After the session, athletes will complete 100 wall balls for time using official HYROX Open category weights. Male athletes will use the Men’s Open weight and female athletes will use the Women’s Open weight. One overall winner with the fastest time takes home an exciting prize.</em></p><p><strong>What this session includes:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Venue:</strong> HyFit HSR, Bangalore — full access to HYROX-appropriate space and equipment.</p></li><li><p><strong>Coaching:</strong> A dedicated trainer assigned to our group, leading a HYROX-focused workout.</p></li><li><p><strong>Programming:</strong> HYROX-focused training designed to build endurance, efficiency, and strength.</p></li><li><p><strong>Community:</strong> A performance-driven environment where athletes keep each other accountable.</p></li><li><p><strong>Recovery Access:</strong> With this pass, you also get access to HyFit’s ice plunge and sauna facilities, perfect for post-session recovery.<br><br></p></li></ul><p></p>"
    },
